"Biscuit downloads official Electron 41.10.7 (113 MiB on Apple silicon or 119 MiB on Intel; extracted payload about 275 MiB and 303 MiB respectively). The ZIP and Electron executable are SHA-256 verified before use. Biscuit retains the complete official runtime payload and its LICENSE / LICENSES.chromium.html notices in a private folder. Nothing is installed globally; personal browser profiles, Codex, and shared runtimes are untouched. Electron's sandbox and OS protections remain enabled." = "Biscuit mengunduh Electron 41.10.7 resmi (113 MiB di Apple silicon atau 119 MiB di Intel; payload hasil ekstrak masing-masing sekitar 275 MiB dan 303 MiB). ZIP dan executable Electron diverifikasi dengan SHA-256 sebelum digunakan. Biscuit menyimpan seluruh payload runtime resmi beserta pemberitahuan LICENSE / LICENSES.chromium.html di folder pribadi. Tidak ada yang dipasang secara global; profil browser pribadi, Codex, dan runtime bersama tidak disentuh. Sandbox Electron dan perlindungan OS tetap aktif.";
"Biscuit downloads the configured GitHub release, verifies its SHA-256 digest when published, bundle identity, version, universal architectures, macOS compatibility, and code signature, then keeps your current app as a rollback copy before replacing it. Your data and preferences stay in place. The app folder must be writable; Biscuit never requests administrator access." = "Biscuit mengunduh rilis GitHub yang dikonfigurasi, memverifikasi digest SHA-256 jika diterbitkan, identitas bundle, versi, arsitektur universal, kompatibilitas macOS, dan tanda tangan kode, lalu menyimpan app saat ini sebagai salinan pemulihan sebelum menggantinya. Data dan preferensi Anda tetap utuh. Folder app harus dapat ditulisi; Biscuit tidak pernah meminta akses administrator.";
