"The update failed and automatic restoration was incomplete. Keep both app copies and contact the Biscuit maintainers." = "Pembaruan gagal dan pemulihan otomatis tidak selesai. Simpan kedua salinan app dan hubungi pengelola Biscuit.";
"The update is not a valid Biscuit app bundle. Your installed copy was not changed." = "Pembaruan bukan bundle app Biscuit yang valid. Salinan terpasang tidak diubah.";
