"Use OpenAI's public Codex PKCE protocol with biscuit branding. Credentials are stored only in biscuit's Keychain. Device-code login is a distinct provider flow." = "Gunakan protokol PKCE Codex publik OpenAI dengan branding biscuit. Kredensial hanya disimpan di Keychain biscuit. Login kode perangkat adalah alur penyedia yang berbeda.";
"Use browser PKCE sign-in for native Claude. OAuth tokens are stored only in biscuit's separate Keychain service. Biscuit never reads Claude Code credentials; remaining usage is retrieved only when you explicitly select Refresh." = "Gunakan login PKCE browser untuk Claude native. Token OAuth hanya disimpan di layanan Keychain biscuit yang terpisah. Biscuit tidak pernah membaca kredensial Claude Code; sisa penggunaan hanya diambil saat Anda secara eksplisit memilih Segarkan.";
